OL,3,AWelsh Greens back plan to separate from
OL,4,AEnglish party                          
OL,6,FWelsh party leader Anthony Slaughter   
OL,7,Fsaid the move was a "positive step" at 
OL,8,Fa "transformational time" for Welsh    
OL,9,FGreens.                                
